; Like beancount's parser, which feeds its display context with each amount
; it reads, the amounts of a transaction a syntax error drops count towards
; display precision: USD has no digits four times and two digits twice.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "kept"
  Assets:A   20.00 USD
  Assets:B  -20.00 USD

2020-01-03 * "dropped by a syntax error"
  Assets:A   1 USD
  Assets:B  -1 USD
  Assets:B   3 USD 4

2020-01-04 balance Assets:A 20 USD
